{"asset_key":"mn/gameplay_story_10645030","episode":"mn","category":"gameplay_story","story_id":"10645030","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1064503001:0":{"text":"お母さん……お母さーん……！うぅ……","source_cn":"妈妈——妈妈——！呜呜……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x24AFA3045ED16DF0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1064503002:0":{"text":"バルトーク、来ちゃダメ！早く逃げなさい……！","source_cn":"巴托克，别过来！快跑啊……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD04F3CE9F5A40510","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1064503003:0":{"text":"グオオーーッ！","source_cn":"嗬——吼——！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3497D98A1520C4A7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1064503004:0":{"text":"やめてーーっ！","source_cn":"不——！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC2CD87DFE14E778B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1064503005:1":{"text":"魔物が幼いバルトークに追いつきかけた、その瞬間――","source_cn":"魔物追上小巴托克的前一刻——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x711960911634FCD9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1064503006:1":{"text":"金色の音符が戦火の中を縦横に駆け巡り、線光となって魔物をその場に縛りつけた。","sour