認するように、肩口の羽根をそっと整えた。","source_cn":"随后，奥菲戈斯轻轻整理肩侧的羽毛，确认每一根都归于应处...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x784DF754B04EB511","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1064503012:0":{"text":"バルトーク……もう大丈夫……大丈夫よ……","source_cn":"巴托克……没事了……没事了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA45D614FF380FFCC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1064503013:0":{"text":"お母さん……ぼく、きれいな音楽が聞こえた気がする……","source_cn":"妈妈，我好像听到了动听的音乐声……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6C57A489AFC31F52","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1064503014:0":{"text":"だ、だからね……もうぜんぜん怖くないよ……！","source_cn":"我、我好像没有那么害怕了……！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x718A1D3F6F22F61A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1064503015:0":{"text":"この音色……まさかシルフィス様！？あの伝説の、音律を司るセレスチアルが降臨されたの……！？","source_cn":"乐曲声……难道、难道是奥菲戈斯大人？传说中的音律半神降...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5BAC695EAB3A9E7D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1064503016:0":{"text":"シルフィスは黙って頷いた。まるで、演奏を終えた奏者が静かに一礼するように。","source_cn":"奥菲戈斯没有否认，微微颌首，像是为这场演出谢幕。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x269A0A3237E25882","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1064503017:0":{"text":"なんと……伝説は本当だったのね……","source_cn":"天呐，传说原来是真的……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE8C90ABC73736E3D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1064503018:0":{"text":"シルフィス様が降臨なさったということは、この戦もすぐに終わるのでしょうか？","source_cn":"奥菲戈斯大人，您降临了，战争是不是很快就能平息了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA19E7885AA14D72E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1064503019:0":{"text":"セレスチアルの力なら、確かにこの世の不協和音を消し去れますわ。","source_cn":"半神的力量，的确能抹去这世间不协之声。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4095B0D88E28D19A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1064503020:0":{"text":"けれど、わたくしが去れば、神力によって抑えられていた狂騒はいずれまた蘇るでしょう。","source_cn":"可我一旦离开，受神力镇压的躁动，终会卷土重来。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7D3063397DF2A515","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1064503021:1":{"text":"人には人の音色があります。それを雑音にしてしまうのか、それとも調和へ導くのか……選ぶのは、人自身なのです。","source_cn":"凡人自有其乐音，是任由它沦为噪音，还是归于和谐，需要自...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x168D1767AEB68D75","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1064503022:0":{"text":"そう言うと、花木の香りの余韻だけを残し、シルフィスは空へと舞い上がっていった。","source_cn":"随后，奥菲戈斯振翅而起，花木清香糅杂在余韵中，久久不散。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5C58BB01C84B8F6B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:35:1064503023:0":{"text":"少年バルトークは、遠ざかるその姿をいつまでも見つめていた。荘厳かつ清らかな旋律がなおも胸に響く。その瞬間、壊れた世界に新たな鼓動（リズム）が刻まれた――","source_cn":"少年巴托克望着远去的身影，庄严、纯净的旋律仍在他脑海中...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x14EA4549947A65D2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:36:1064503024:0":{"text":"お母さん……ぼく、やりたいことが見つかった気がする……","source_cn":"妈妈，我好像找到了方向——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB91391D07B58AD62","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:37:1064503025:0":{"text":"音楽家になりたい！いろんな場所へ行って、さっき聞いたメロディーをたくさんの人に届けるんだ！","source_cn":"我想成为一名音乐家，去很多很多地方，为许许多多的人，奏...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCCBE8FF281407368","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:39:1064503026:0":{"text":"お母さん……魔物……","source_cn":"妈妈……魔物……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x029A6276B97BAD90","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:40:1064503027:0":{"text":"音楽……し、シルフィス……様……","source_cn":"音乐……奥菲、奥菲戈斯……神啊……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA0A8C64D1EEFEFCF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:42:1064503028:0":{"text":"バルトークは目を開けた。倉庫は相変わらず薄暗く、耳鳴りも消えていない。彼は頭を揉みながら、少しずつ現実へと意識を戻していく。","source_cn":"巴托克睁眼，仓库内仍旧昏暗，耳中的嗡鸣没有消失。他揉了...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x866B16E0EADC2811","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:43:1064503029:1":{"text":"ふと目の前に散らばる楽譜に視線を移すと、見覚えのない、端正な筆跡の書き込みが加えられていた――","source_cn":"眼前散落的乐谱上，不知何时多了几行字迹清隽的陌生批注——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1553363958886065","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:44:1064503030:1":{"text":"「第九小節――デクレッシェンド、最後はしっかり収める」","source_cn":"“第九小节——渐弱，收束力度”","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x51E31E83CFD792B3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:45:1064503031:1":{"text":"「第二十三小節――ここはレガートで、一弓で弾き切る。」","source_cn":"“第二十三小节——此处的连奏，一弓到底”","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF8581F64D161F9E1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:47:1064503032:0":{"text":"この花木の香り……まさか……","source_cn":"这种花木的清香……这是……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x23E0146108D3DFA7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:48:1064503033:1":{"text":"<shk>間違いない――シルフィス様だ！ここに来ていたんだ！</shk>","source_cn":"<shk>这是——奥菲戈斯女士的气息！她来过！</shk>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6F159FA0C4693395","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:50:1064503034:1":{"text":"バルトークは急いで楽器の前に戻り、書き込みに従って、再び演奏を始めた。","source_cn":"巴托克急忙回到乐器前，按照几行批注，又一次开始排演。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDA39E9B571D71E77","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:51:1064503035:1":{"text":"目を閉じる。耳の中の濁った違和感はやはり消えない。それでも弦のかすかな震えと、床から伝わるリズムは感じ取れる。","source_cn":"他闭上眼，耳中浑浊的嗡鸣并未消散。可琴弦在细微颤动，脚...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5E83F209AE706513","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:52:1064503036:1":{"text":"ばらばらだった旋律が少しずつ拍を刻み始め、まるで暗闇の中に楽譜が浮かび上がる感覚を覚えた。","source_cn":"那些散乱的旋律渐渐连成节拍，如同黑暗中重新亮起的谱线。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4B56B6D134038BF8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:53:1064503037:1":{"text":"聴覚を失った世界で、バルトークは確かに、荘厳で揺るぎない、かつてない調和を感じ取っていた。","source_cn":"在听觉的废墟里，巴托克再一次感知到庄严、稳定、非凡的和谐。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x20F4DD017F912EA5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:55:1064503038:1":{"text":"聞こえなくなったからといって、音楽は私から離れたわけではなかった……","source_cn":"原来失去听觉，并不意味着音乐已经离我而去……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1BDDD9AD0065C910","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:56:1064503039:1":{"text":"シルフィス様……あなたの導きに従って、私はこれからも奏で続けます。","source_cn":"奥菲戈斯女士，我会循着您的指引，演奏下去。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x30A4B58978F7F378","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:少年巴托克":{"text":"少年のバルトーク","source":"少年巴托克","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:巴托克的母亲":{"text":"バルトークの母","source":"巴托克的母亲","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:魔物":{"text":"魔物","source":"魔物","status":"source"},"speaker:旁白":{"text":"ナレーション","source":"旁白","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:奥菲戈斯":{"text":"シルフィス","source":"奥菲戈斯","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:巴托克":{"text":"バルトーク","source":"巴托克","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":40,"localized_text_count":39,"speaker_count":6}}